# Compiled binary: `go build` in this module root emits an executable named
# after the module (elitea-llm-gateway). Anchored to the root so it never
# matches the cmd/elitea-llm-gateway/ SOURCE package. 37MB artifact — build it
# in CI, never commit it.
/elitea-llm-gateway

# Generated coverage artifacts (scripts/coverage.sh). The cobertura coverage.xml
# is consumed by the BF0.6t validator but is a generated file, not committed —
# regenerate with scripts/coverage.sh or via ci-gateway.yml.
internal/**/coverage.out
internal/**/coverage.xml
